  "prefLabel": "Fis 1002.06 Conservation measures",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Fis 1002.06 “Conservation measures” means actions which serve to avoid, minimize, or mitigate potential adverse impacts to, and to promote the recovery of or enhance the survival of, threatened or endangered species.\n\nSource. #13313, eff 2-3-22",
